<div id="S2.Thmthm1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S2.Thmthm1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">On <math id="S2.Thmthm1.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Gamma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Gamma</annotation></semantics></math>, the differential map can be restricted to a map</p>
