</span></li>
<li id="bib.bib9" class="ltx_bibitem ltx_bib_article"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_bib_key ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">[6]</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_author">S. Canning, H. Larson, and S. Payne</span><span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_year"> (2024)</span>
</span>
